title: "May Poem by Eila Webster"
id: "201505"
poemTitle: "The Merry Month of May"
author: "Eila Webster"
endOfYear: false
---

<div class="full-width">
  <poem-grid :title="poemTitle" :author="author" :theme="bgTheme">
    <!-- Header Section -->
    <img
      src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-1.avif"
      alt=""
      slot="header-tl"
    />
    <!-- <img -->
    <!--   src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-1.avif" -->
    <!--   alt="" -->
    <!--   slot="header-tr" -->
    <!-- /> -->

    <!-- Column 1 Images (15%) -->
    <div slot="col-1-images">
      <img src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-0.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-8.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-2.avif" alt="" />
    </div>

    <!-- Column 2 Text -->
    <div slot="col-2-text">
      <p>
        May month is the stepping stone <br />
        into Summer from the Spring. <br />
        Covering trees with fragrant blossom <br />
        and feathered friends are on the wing.
      </p>

      <p>
        Time to hang up overcoat and scarf <br />
        get outside now and explore. <br />
        There is a wealth of interest there <br />
        Lying right outside your front door.
      </p>

      <p>
        Butterflies look as if they are dancing <br />
        to the humming of the bumble bees. <br />
        The birds are all singing their dawn <br />
        chorus that wafts on the sweet perfumed breeze . <br />
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 3 Middle Images -->
    <div slot="col-3-images">
      <img src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-4.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-3.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-5.avif" alt="" />
    </div>

    <!-- Column 4 Text -->
    <div slot="col-4-text">
      <p>
        Bulbs are bursting into flower <br />
        showing many different kinds of hue. <br />
        It is nature's free gift to everyone<br />
        a real Spring tonic for me and you. <br />
      </p>

      <p>
        From this modern hectic lifestyle now <br />
        Stop! and linger - then take note <br />
        of the beauty all around you here<br />
        in your own special little spot. <br />
      </p>

      <p>
        You'll feel the tension in your body ease <br />
        refreshed and happy ready for the day <br />
        as you find out life can be quite sweet<br />
        Through the Merry Month of May.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 5 Images (15%) -->
    <div slot="col-5-images">
      <img src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-6.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-7.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-9.avif" alt="" />
    </div>
  </poem-grid>
</div>
